  "reviewer_operations": "Read/hash/parse source and metadata, stream archive CRC/member checks, compare source AST/text and existing raw receipts; no new test execution, source changes, Git index/ref/config changes, or artifact extraction to a source tree. Two preliminary reviewer AST checks selected the wrong for-loop / over-assumed prototype-call equality; refined to exact matching mechanical bodies and preserved assertions, not treated as product failures.",
  "schema": 1,
  "scope": "independent read-only pure/static implementation and retained execution review only; not actual U575 pair qualification",
  "static_design_assessment": {
    "member_binding": "Pair member ID order, sizes/modes and digest must match portable inventory; generic store verifies content; metadata reads are bounded and hashes rechecked.",
    "portable_format": "External complete outer-manifest SHA binds pair roles and portable package. Raw gzip/TAR preflight enforces single member/trailer CRC, compressed/logical128MiB, expanded160MiB, metadata8MiB, member4096, unsafe names/duplicates/links/sparse/PAX/special rejection before generic tar interpretation.",
    "qualification": "STATUS stays unsigned/not_qualified/not_executed with qualified=false and promoted=false. Build source is externally anchored recorded data, not independent authentication of compiler execution or clean checkout.",
    "software_checks": "Static code recomputes runtime labelled-length input hashes, generator closure, CPU/security flags, paired ELF/vector/SG/import and decoded CMSE/nonsecure checks. These paths have not yet received the new complete real-pair positive execution.",
    "source_root_context": "Verifier ownroot is explicitly dirty with uninitialized unrelated submodules; no clean-source candidate claim admitted.",
    "trusted_tools": "Only caller-pinned external nm/objdump identities matching report tool digests are executed on small temporary ELF/import views. Archived compiler/scripts/tool bytes/argv remain inert.",
    "typed_authority": "Exact documented report positions only; context/report/tool identities equal; conflicting histories and original report input conflicts rejected before union overwrite; externally anchored metadata documents are separately reconciled."
  },
  "verdict": "PASS"
